    "title": "Victim identified after deadly West Warwick crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jusolyn Flower ,\n6 hours ago WEST WARWICK, R.I. (WPRI) — Officials have identified the 37-year-old man who was killed after crashing into a wall in West Warwick over the weekend. The incident happened Sunday night at the intersection of Brookside Avenue and Crossen Street. Police said the driver, James Mitchell of West Warwick, later died at the hospital. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
